WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.260
young soldiers, mostly, mostly soldiers,

00:00:03.260 --> 00:00:06.600
on both sides, every single week,

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:10.080
from 5,000 to 7,000 dead young people.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:14.000
And some in cities, much smaller numbers,

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.799
where rockets are shot, where drones are dropped.

